{"id":"n60512-1-7","stage":4,"title":"빈소 · 灵堂","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60512-1-7-1","ko":"민준이의 아버님께서 오늘 새벽에 돌아가셨대.","zh":"听说敏俊的父亲今天凌晨去世了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이의","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}},{"text":"아버님께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버님：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버님","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71340","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버님께서","audio":"/audio/105a58bb64722e4799cb.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"새벽에","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새벽에","audio":"/audio/0caa7eb4a0f8e3ed42cb.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가셨대.","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가셨대","audio":"/audio/653c7dcb20e28510c820.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"64187c187ea07eb8","term":"아버님","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/64187c187ea07eb8ba99.mp3","entryId":"71340","definition":"(尊称)在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버님"]},{"id":"3bc623